      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E002",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "In this action alleging a slip and fall on a wet floor inside defendants' building shortly after it had been raining, triable issues of fact exist as to defendants' claimed lack of notice and their precautions in light of the dangerous condition.",
