      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E005",
        "passage_id": "P003",
        "quote": "Furthermore, while defendants were not required to cover the entire floor with mats, under the facts of this case the gap between the mat and the stairs raised an issue of fact as to the adequacy of defendants' precautions.",
